# Canonical research state is line-ending sensitive. A digest computed over CRLF
# bytes on Windows and over LF bytes on Linux is a digest of the operating system,
# not of the artifact. Forcing LF on every text format this repository hashes makes
# a committed digest reproducible on any clone.
#
# See docs/PROVENANCE.md ("Why committed bytes, not working-tree bytes").
* text=auto eol=lf

*.yaml text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf

# Binary research artifacts must never be normalised.
*.parquet binary
*.gguf    binary
*.safetensors binary
*.bin     binary